,{"_key":543,"_type":436,"marks":544,"text":545},"ec5901569df1",[]," of CFOs believe AI will significantly impact daily financial activities",[547],{"_key":540,"_type":472,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":548},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.cfo.com\u002Fnews\u002Fthe-ai-ultimatum-why-cfos-cant-afford-to-wait\u002F730797\u002F",{"_key":550,"_type":432,"children":551,"level":17,"listItem":499,"markDefs":561,"style":440},"eb2be5e9a974",[552,557],{"_key":553,"_type":436,"marks":554,"text":556},"f43f37690dc0",[555],"953e4929-a54c-492c-9c77-3d3ffd902e53","72%",{"_key":558,"_type":436,"marks":559,"text":560},"b0cffaba7b88",[]," of organizations have now implemented AI in at least one business function",[562],{"_key":555,"_type":472,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":563},"https:\u002F\u002Fwww.mckinsey.com\u002Fcapabilities\u002Fquantumblack\u002Four-insights\u002Fthe-state-of-ai#\u002F",{"_key":565,"_type":432,"children":566,"level":17,"listItem":499,"markDefs":576,"style":440},"4149262be9ed",[567,571],{"_key":568,"_type":436,"marks":569,"text":570},"ec02a01c217f",[],"Decision-making accuracy has improved by ",{"_key":572,"_type":436,"marks":573,"text":575},"9606de3cc756",[574],"c6ec6368-57a1-4093-81cf-4e6cb29fc2d4","30%",[577],{"_key":574,"_type":472,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":578},"https:\u002F\u002Fitsupplychain.com\u002Fthe-impact-of-ai-data-analytics-on-business-decision-making",{"_key":580,"_type":432,"children":581,"markDefs":586,"style":482},"3591ccdc0183",[582],{"_key":583,"_type":436,"marks":584,"text":585},"531fa2239741",[],"Enhanced Decision-Making Powered by AI",[],{"_key":588,"_type":432,"children":589,"markDefs":594,"style":440},"6f7c0fc35094",[590],{"_key":591,"_type":436,"marks":592,"text":593},"cb78bba715fd",[],"Deloitte’s 2023 study shared that 42% of CFOs are adopting AI software for their teams. This shift highlights the growing interest on AI in the financial industry to optimize manual tasks, minimize human errors, and make real-time strategic decisions. AI is helping companies streamline processes while providing a solid foundation for smarter and faster decision-making.",[],{"_key":596,"_type":432,"children":597,"markDefs":602,"style":482},"998806ce1193",[598],{"_key":599,"_type":436,"marks":600,"text":601},"8d65c0543ef1",[],"Efficiency Gains Across the Financial Landscape",[],{"_key":604,"_type":432,"children":605,"markDefs":619,"style":440},"2024e651f3d9",[606,610,615],{"_key":607,"_type":436,"marks":608,"text":609},"1dc841c16aef",[],"AI is creating great impacts on accounting operations. Companies that have integrated AI solutions report ",{"_key":611,"_type":436,"marks":612,"text":614},"d550dfbec86d",[613],"1dc13de9-a060-42b5-8e50-c89f067c50a0","saving over 200 hours",{"_key":616,"_type":436,"marks":617,"text":618},"81b116c26d1a",[]," annually on manual tasks with automation. Processes like financial reporting, balance sheet creation, and financial close are now completed 40% faster. Manual data entry tasks have decreased by 55%, allowing organizations to focus more on strategic and complex objectives.",[620],{"_key":613,"_type":472,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":621},"https:\u002F\u002Fthe-cfo.io\u002F2024\u002F11\u002F07\u002F200-hours-thats-how-long-ai-could-save-you-in-fpa\u002F",{"_key":623,"_type":432,"children":624,"markDefs":629,"style":482},"1cf69d6021d2",[625],{"_key":626,"_type":436,"marks":627,"text":628},"c4c6857fd9e0",[],"A Global Surge in AI Adoption",[],{"_key":631,"_type":432,"children":632,"markDefs":637,"style":440},"0f914b132854",[633],{"_key":634,"_type":436,"marks":635,"text":636},"3d751ae224e6",[],"A McKinsey report on the state of AI in 2024 highlights a significant increase in AI adoption. Approximately 72% of organizations have now implemented AI in at least one business function, marking a sharp increase from just 50% in previous years. More than two-thirds of companies reported leveraging AI technologies, with nearly half integrating AI into two or more functional areas. Generative AI is creating a strong foot print in marketing, sales, IT, and product development, and it's already introducing more innovative applications in accounting and finance.",[],{"_key":639,"_type":432,"children":640,"markDefs":645,"style":482},"51ce74eff5ac",[641],{"_key":642,"_type":436,"marks":643,"text":644},"7846a91739ef",[],"The Big 4 Accounting Firms",[],{"_key":647,"_type":432,"children":648,"markDefs":653,"style":440},"44f59904bac4",[649],{"_key":650,"_type":436,"marks":651,"text":652},"84f1659f4337",[],"The Big 4—KPMG, PwC, EY, and Deloitte—have been early adopters in AI integration, setting new industry standards for others to follow. These firms have heavily invested in advanced AI technologies, delivering innovative solutions to clients while continuously enhancing modern accounting practices.",[],{"_key":655,"_type":432,"children":656,"markDefs":661,"style":482},"0421bb1fad7f",[657],{"_key":658,"_type":436,"marks":659,"text":660},"18fe2737d414",[],"Looking Ahead",[],{"_key":663,"_type":432,"children":664,"markDefs":669,"style":440},"61f602d5d40d",[665],{"_key":666,"_type":436,"marks":667,"text":668},"912ecf9ebe5c",[],"As we enter into the new year, the momentum of AI's transformative impact on finance and accounting continues to expand. Agentic AI is reshaping company operations, automating accounting workflows, and minimizing the need for manual data processing. This shift empowers accounting and finance professionals to focus on high-value strategic tasks.",[],{"_key":671,"_type":432,"children":672,"markDefs":677,"style":440},"bd9da57cf91a",[673],{"_key":674,"_type":436,"marks":675,"text":676},"9da269005419",[],"A majority of CFOs are already embracing AI to scale their businesses and uncover new opportunities. In 2025, the influence of Agentic AI will continue to grow, fostering innovation, driving strategic growth, and opening new possibilities across the industry.",[],{"_key":679,"_type":432,"children":680,"markDefs":694,"style":440},"6c64cf701f33",[681,685,690],{"_key":682,"_type":436,"marks":683,"text":684},"af51a20ce294",[],"Discover how autonomous AI is redefining finance and accounting operations.Download ",{"_key":686,"_type":436,"marks":687,"text":689},"41e72d8d101c",[688],"98e39038-67f0-4d70-a9a7-896bbc89ce98","Agentic AI: The Next Frontier of Autonomous Automation in Finance and Accounting",{"_key":691,"_type":436,"marks":692,"text":693},"5fae9efeaed6",[]," to learn how digital agents are transforming reconciliation, reporting, and strategic decision-making.",[695],{"_key":688,"_type":472,"linkPageModule":9,"newTab":30,"page":9,"type":124,"url":696},"https:\u002F\u002Finfo.nominal.so\u002Fwp\u002Fai-agents-accounting?utm_medium=organic&utm_source=blog&utm_campaign=white-paper-agentic-ai",{"_key":698,"_type":699,"fullWidth":9,"htmlCode":700,"label":9,"markDefs":9},"684e17e125c7","htmlEmbed","\u003C!--HubSpot Call-to-Action Code -->\u003Cspan class=\"hs-cta-wrapper\" id=\"hs-cta-wrapper-80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72\">\u003Cspan class=\"hs-cta-node hs-cta-80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72\" id=\"hs-cta-80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72\">\u003C!--[if lte IE 8]>\u003Cdiv id=\"hs-cta-ie-element\">\u003C\u002Fdiv>\u003C![endif]-->\u003Ca href=\"https:\u002F\u002Fcta-redirect.hubspot.com\u002Fcta\u002Fredirect\u002F48589798\u002F80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\u003Cimg class=\"hs-cta-img\" id=\"hs-cta-img-80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72\" style=\"border-width:0px;\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fno-cache.hubspot.com\u002Fcta\u002Fdefault\u002F48589798\u002F80635fc7-23a8-4183-b68d-147b9b35da72.png\"  alt=\"Agentic AI  The next frontier of Autonomous Automation in Finance and Accounting.  Download\"\u002F>\u003C\u002Fa>\u003C\u002Fspan>\u003Cscript charset=\"utf-8\" src=\"https:\u002F\u002Fjs.hscta.net\u002Fcta\u002Fcurrent.js\">\u003C\u002Fscript>\u003Cscrip